{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vi2UnvJ8QX2RuCt65e1a3w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.378344+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Vi2UnvJ8QX2RuCt65e1a3w","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/InhARkmBgAgoXpclibahBYiabxhyxQ2dAxpMcENjDvCYQISibaMIIqk0B106owpnnZkHJ6V8RibYpl7SRQOVRoGz2g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>活动通知</span></p></section><section></section><section><p><span>2026年全国优秀学子“行知”夏令营</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国高校公共管理学科优秀学生之间的思想交流，提升青年学生学术素养和创新性解决公共管理领域实际问题的能力，加强青年学生与国内外公共管理领域专家教授的联系，增进国内高校本科生对南京农业大学公共管理学科的认识，南京农业大学公共管理学院将于南京举行2026年全国优秀学子“行知”夏令营，为热爱科研、基础扎实、素质全面、德才兼备的优秀学子搭建继续深造和发展的平台，提供与名师直接交流的机会、感知名师魅力的契机、感受百年名校文化底蕴的途径。</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营涉及</span><strong><span>土地资源管理、行政管理、社会保障、教育经济与管理</span></strong><span>四个专业，主要包括公共管理前沿报告、学科介绍、学术交流等环节。欢迎有志于公共管理研究的优秀大学生积极报名参加。</span></p><p><span>申请工作自即日开始，活动安排将另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2klHPG9qDp2zZkbedfsk04AviaCj9Xib0s7T11ELibISlmAkIJa1tgK1tQTcrCZiapodtybkicUibI0sgQu7d0cWyWnMS8WXCveTPDnP4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.对土地资源管理、行政管理、社会保障、教育经济与管理专业有着浓厚的学术兴趣，遵守学术道德规范的</span><strong><span>本科三年级学生</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.申请者原则上为公共管理一级学科相关专业学生，同时也欢迎相关学科优秀学生跨专业申请。</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优秀，本科生在校综合成绩排名在本专业</span><strong><span>前20%</span></strong><span>，对于科研成果特别突出的申请者，学习成绩标准可适当放宽。</span></p><p><span>4.英语水平良好，原则上需满足</span><strong><span>国家六级水平（425分及以上）、托福（TOEFL）成绩80分及以上、雅思(IELTS)成绩达5.0分及以上</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2kmOwmxZYuv4xmxk1eoW71FQetNVBYicBaS6ZpYx1dxxJoicGjIklgSaEBrO1Fk20WMOTA25w5qzyoK3xDyPQPefmGO2e76Ns7kS4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>研究论文（设计）</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>研究论文必须选择公共管理学科领域相关主题；申请者任选研究方法，但须符合社会科学研究方法之规范。对暂未形成研究论文的，可提交研究设计。设计中至少包含以下内容：选题依据（学界关于此问题的研究综述等）、研究内容（研究的具体问题与对象、研究假设、研究目标等）、研究方法（具体的研究方法、技术等）、研究可能的创新与不足之处。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学术简历</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请者需提交能够充分展示自身学术功底的简历一份，其中包含个人基本信息、教育背景、修习课程、学术经历、学术成果、所获荣誉、社会实践等。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推荐信等其他证明材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>提供两名相关学科领域专家（副教授及以上）推荐信（需专家签名）、学生成绩单和专业排名（复印件须加盖教务处公章）、已发表论文、各种荣誉证书、六级成绩单等各类材料扫描件。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营申请表和申请信息汇总表</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>请在通知附件下载（文末“阅读全文”）。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>注：申请材料共四项内容，提交邮件时，请将研究论文（设计）、夏令营申请表和申请信息汇总表放在一个文件夹，并命名为“</span><strong><span>申请表+研究论文</span></strong><span>”；其他两项材料放在另一个文件夹，命名为“</span><strong><span>其他材料</span></strong><span>”，最终两个文件夹再放在另一个文件夹里，命名格式与邮件标题相同。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2klSXUpiarxxEEUXvswuVerPc9wXVcjubwLPKKwxZzZjlaKcEicbJWxQ7ibjBxdVMzuicmtJ7sGogpP8302eMI8WozcdSC3eyHdgFco/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请符合申报资格且有意向的同学，于2026年6月28日中午12点前将申请材料电子版发至邮箱：hyj@njau.edu.cn，邮件标题为“</span><strong><span>报名专业+申请人姓名+夏令营+联系方式</span></strong><span>”，如“土地资源管理+张三+夏令营+13012345678”。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2kmo8ed2IvEg2icBzH23bcJFC7dd1U15W4CfdTPOYsLDXC015v0OyeSJROnZ3mtsKHS9iaoIrfOZhrzArS31nLXGBSFswSNHsqIIc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.南京农业大学公共管理学院将于申请截止后一周内对申请材料进行审核。</span></p><p><span>2.该活动由南京农业大学公共管理学院夏令营组委会负责。入选营员名单将于</span><strong><span>7月初</span></strong><span>在本院网站公布并以</span><strong><span>短信形式</span></strong><span>通知本人，未入选者不再另行通知；入选者如有变故而不能参加，请第一时间告知主办方。</span></p><p><span>3.入营人数为</span><strong><span>85人</span></strong><span>左右。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2kmIBDiaefHaqrGTu6Sibfv7hmHrjlgcNq3Aoib8HDZhdcribhbYOG78oicJelhb7jb0UPjLYTFspqP1uUD9phMtLyGibkIG2BMSm2VSY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>时间：2026年7月9日-10日</span></p><p><span>形式：</span><strong><span>线上线下结合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2kns4kpd7ibdNhZZR7fvLvl6Y0yiaKroCW239LfkgmauLMGMFxJAuPdNZ73EArbugIGOhvB6YVLNVCnia1HkrR6YNibXEKqb9OGtWN4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名学生请在汇总表里填写意向参与形式。学院为线下入营的同学提供7月9日晚间住宿(南京市区和本校学生不安排)，以及7月9日晚餐、7月10日三餐学校食堂餐券。学员请自行预订往返车票，费用自理，可保留相关车费票据和付款记录，待入学后可报销（南京市区和本校学生不报销）:路费(限动车/高铁二等座、火车硬座/硬卧或长途汽车，行程需要形成往返闭环)。学院为线下入营的同学购买7月9-10日旅途意外保险。</span></p><p><span>2.营员在夏令营期间应遵守国家及地方法律法规、南京农业大学等的相关规定，遵循统一安排参加活动；未在规定时间内报到者视为自动放弃；一经发现申请者申报材料有弄虚作假内容，立即取消申请人资格，并保留追责的权利。</span></p><p><span>3.本通知内容如与学校发布的相关文件要求不同，将根据学校文件进行相应调整。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RUfteXqZ2kkfLrO2Pqq1273TaWMf08Aa9e5WH3vj0SI3Rdicy721OOnAYgiaV7pJhkecGgxQwV37H8MCGh4LnMhOHsbjc7UwCiaPdKtvJfF3QM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>韩老师，电话：025-84399561，</span></p><p><span>           邮箱：hyj@njau.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>曾崇文，电话：19850975618</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>南京农业大学公共管理学院</span></p><p><span>2026年6月23日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>点击文末“阅读全文”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>下载夏令营申请表和申请信息汇总表</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>提取码：</span><strong><span>y6hh</span></strong></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RUfteXqZ2kkowVtaJ2xSzcEJE46NJmGbNYlIjCqOeEWug6I3l0l7L00etiauWzU3njb2xoxiclmsCQoSUR3Fo1Gpy6km4zUakStXCqrK6OaSs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>编辑 | 曾崇文</span></p><p><span>责任编辑 | 杨思嘉</span></p><p><span>校对 | 韩一杰 欧杨林</span></p><p><span>审核 | 刘红光</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"babe196fc10c4ca2e4d4be203e4d425e4965797122d3b696673c34af8d3364bf","textLength":1815,"sourceSha256":"b6e778599d062295ec0cd9109c36651d07c97ecb95724c26fcfa77dd67ccf643","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-917f363fb29c5ca74ae6","title":"2026年南京农业大学公共管理学院2026年全国优秀学子“行知”夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:43.378344+00:00"}
